  "selection_rationale": "These two analyses use the existing randomized description assignments under the two available mediator interventions. Together they distinguish the three benchmark predictions more directly than observational mediation: fixing legitimacy probes whether framing can reach usefulness independently, while fixing usefulness probes whether legitimacy can support interest independently. Baseline estimates establish whether framing has an effect in the unblocked setting. I do not select encouragement-based instrumental-variable analyses because their exclusion assumptions are unestablished. This is the final evidence request; ambiguous intervention validity or imprecise estimates will leave the mechanisms unresolved."
